{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は沈金でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゲストは\nCUBERSのTAKAさんと末吉9太郎さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二枚目のTAKAさんと個性的な末吉9太郎さん\nお二人のバランスがすごく良くて\n面白かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、１つ前のブログでは\n告知が間に合わなかったんですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"15thシングルのアンダー曲\n『シークレットグラフィティー』\n解禁しちゃいましたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダー曲では久々に明るい曲で\n嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまにぴったりな曲だなって思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"MVもお楽しみにね～\n生駒ちゃんが絶賛してくれてたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週は\nフリースタイルラップのコーナーでしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ビートが増えてました！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張りました。もっと頑張ります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週はAIですね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマは\n「正しい夏休みの過ごし方」ですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AIに教えてあげてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう\n沈金の前日に\nたまたまアルピーさんにお会いしました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈金歴3か月にして\n初めて中田のスマホで写メ撮ったよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてブログに載せてるよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちまブログの\nひなちまと撮ってる\nアルピーさんの素敵な表情に嫉妬しますが"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/07/02/6397896/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あの写メのカメラマンをした\n中田へ向けての笑顔だと思っておきまーす"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}